# Everything here is in the repo but has no business being on the public
# site. Cloudflare Pages has no ignore mechanism of its own, so the deploy
# workflow rsyncs the repo into dist/ with these excluded and ships that.
#
# Rule of thumb: if a browser has no reason to fetch it, it goes here.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.wrangler/
.msh*/
.audit-*/
.DS_Store
dist/
node_modules/
context.md
docs/
*.mjs

# Worker source — wrangler.toml carries the account and KV namespace ids
worker/

# Health archive — the Worker owns health now; these are kept for history
health/
.health/

# Your voice print. This must never be served from the public site —
# a one-minute clean recording of you speaking is all anyone needs to
# clone your voice. It lives here for convenience; it ships nowhere.
public/

# README hero and other docs — the site does not fetch these.
docs/

# Not part of the site
non biographical:academic research/
index.html.v1-backup
# No shell script on this site is meant to be downloadable.
*.sh

# Unused pre-crop portrait sources — 25MB nothing links to. Kept in git as
# the originals for future crops; two of them are AI-generated and have no
# business being served from a site that bans AI imagery.
portraits/Gemini_Generated_Image_*.png
portraits/non formal portrait*.png
portraits/IMG_4734.jpg

# Operator workspaces. Not part of the public site.
yt-channel/
.firecrawl/

# The desk-machine agenda listener. It is not a page.
sidecar/

# Working documents and gate fixtures. They were being served to anyone who
# asked (tasks/lessons.md, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, the spatial baseline, the
# probe injected by the gate): not secrets, but internal law and
# lessons-learned a visitor has no use for. Anchored to the repo root so
# city-photos/CREDITS.md, which the site owes its photographers, still ships.
/README.md
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/ANTI-SLOP.md
/CONTRIBUTING.md
/tasks/
/design/
/scripts/
/tools/
